---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CaseCard from "../components/CaseCard.astro";

const featured = (await getCollection("cases"))
  .filter((item) => item.data.featured)
  .sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-id">
      <div><p class="hero-name">杨两只｜无限袤 MAU Studio</p><p class="hero-role">Brand &amp; Creative Studio</p></div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Shanghai · Independent Creative Practice</p>
    </div>
    <h1>让想象，<br />在现实<span>生根。</span></h1>
    <div class="hero-bottom">
      <p>我从研究、策略与文字出发，为品牌建立故事、内容与创意方向，并与设计师及不同领域的伙伴协作，让想法真正落地。</p>
      <div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/cases/">View Cases</a><a class="button secondary" href="/contact/">Contact</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="page-shell">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">What I Do</p><h2>从核心想法，<br />到真实发生。</h2></div>
      <div class="service-grid">
        <article class="service-card"><span class="num">01</span><h3>品牌策略与叙事</h3><p>梳理品牌定位、核心主张与故事，建立可持续使用的品牌内容基础。</p></article>
        <article class="service-card"><span class="num">02</span><h3>品牌内容建设</h3><p>规划社交媒体、栏目与长期内容方向，让品牌形成稳定而有辨识度的表达。</p></article>
        <article class="service-card"><span class="num">03</span><h3>创意概念与策划</h3><p>为品牌项目、传播与线下体验建立创意主题、内容结构与完整故事线。</p></article>
        <article class="service-card"><span class="num">04</span><h3>产品与包装叙事</h3><p>从产品概念、命名与包装文案出发，把产品价值转化为可感知的体验。</p></article>
        <article class="service-card"><span class="num">05</span><h3>展览与空间内容</h3><p>为展览、商业空间与设计项目梳理叙事，让内容在真实场景中发生。</p></article>
      </div>
      <div class="service-entry"><p>暂时说不清品牌表达的问题在哪里？</p><a class="arrow-link" href="/services/#brand-checkup">了解 45 分钟品牌表达体检 <span>↗</span></a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Featured Cases</p><h2>Selected Work</h2></div>
      <div class="case-grid">{featured.map((entry, index) => <CaseCard entry={entry} index={index} />)}</div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="about-preview">
        <h2>我是杨两只，也是无限袤 MAU Studio 的创意主理人。</h2>
        <div>
          <p>我持续研究品牌如何通过策略、故事、内容与创意，建立人与品牌之间的连接。</p>
          <p>从艺术设计、媒体编辑到品牌项目，我习惯先理解问题、找到核心，再与合适的创作伙伴协作，让想法成为能够被看见、理解和体验的现实。</p>
          <a class="arrow-link" href="/about/">More About Me <span>↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="credential-row"><p>艺术设计背景</p><p>媒体与内容经验</p><p>品牌策略与创意协作</p></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section studio-notes">
      <div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Studio Notes</p><h2>创意如何从一个念头，<br />逐渐成为现实。</h2></div>
      <div class="studio-notes-content">
        <p>在“无限袤 MAU Studio”的小红书账号，我会分享更多创意项目的落地案例、过程记录，以及仍在生长中的概念与想法。</p>
        <a class="button" href="https://xhslink.cn/m/1u6DD3sjsmd" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">前往无限袤 MAU Studio <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="contact-band">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h2>如果你有一个想法，<br />我们可以从这里开始。</h2>
    <div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/contact/">开始交流</a><a class="button secondary" href="weixin://dl/chat?yoko858yoko">微信 yoko858yoko</a></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
